      "text": "100 draws · seed 0 · the model clock from start to end\nstart: explicit, else the last retained time, else the initial anchor\nDiffrax Heun SDE: a diverging path stays non-finite for the checks\ntrue emission laws · with interventions, a paired reference without them\ninputs replay the panel and hold beyond the record\ninput interventions cancel later record assignments",
